<title>USA: NYSE suspends Compania Boliviana shares.</title>
<headline>NYSE suspends Compania Boliviana shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said it suspended trading in the common stock of Compania Boliviana de Energia Electrica SA, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The NYSE also said it would apply to the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to delist the stock.</p>
<p>The NYSE said it normally seeks to delist issues with fewer than 600,000 common shares held by the public.</p>
<p>It said that as a result of a tender offer by NRG Energy Inc, fewer than 600,000 shares of Compania Boliviana remain publicly held.</p>
</text>
